                                                "sense_id": "1e4b1aff-dfaf-3b66-a004-35a7cf108c28",
                                                "text": "His orders are clear and concise – the Scots are viewed as untermenschen and are to be treated accordingly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "21b92b48-80d0-42eb-9a46-8396e8c0a74b",
                        "source_entry_id": "6405a47f-0007-3bae-ba29-cae796516e9f",
